            "text": "<p><strong>On days 3–5, levels of FSH, LH, and estradiol are at their baseline. </strong>                     </p><p>This makes results easier to interpret, because they’re not yet influenced by the mid-cycle LH surge or the progesterone rise after ovulation.</p>",
